

WHAT THE EXAMPLE DOES

   Downloads waveforms and performs moment tensor analysis for the North Korean 
   nuclear test that occurred on 2017/09/03 at 03:30:01 UTC.


TO RUN THE EXAMPLE

  1. First install MTUQ_Automater following INSTALL.txt.


  2. Pass the event origin time, latitude, longitude, depth, and magnitude to
     MTUQ_Automater as follows:

     >> new_event  2017-09-03-03-30-01  41.300  129.078  1.  5.42

     The result will be a new directory with a set of customizable scripts for 
     pulling waveforms and setting up and running a moment tensor analysis.


  3. Simply navigate to the new directory

     >> cd 2017-09-03--03-30-01__NORTH_KOREA/

     and then invoke the scripts in order:

     >> bash ./01_pull
     >> bash ./02_setup
     >> bash ./03_run

